  "description": "Model by Robert Ron\n\nQueen Anne’s Revenge is a legendary pirate ship 3D model inspired by the infamous flagship of Blackbeard (Edward Teach). \n\nThis model captures the dark majesty of 18th-century naval warfare, blending historical authenticity with cinematic detail perfect for games or film environments.\n\nThe ship features a heavily armed wooden hull, 32 iron cannons, ornate figurehead, and tattered black sails adorned with the iconic pirate insignia.\n\nThe deck is richly detailed with ropes, barrels, lanterns, and weapon racks, while the captain’s cabin boasts aged wood textures, navigation charts, and gold accents that evoke the aura of fear and fortune.\n\nBuilt with modular design, the model allows easy customization — from clean museum-ready presentation to battle-worn realism.\n\nThe Queen Anne’s Revenge sails again as a symbol of rebellion, terror, and the untamed spirit of the seas.",
